<title>HONG KONG: BZW sets warrants on China consumption basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on China consumption basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd said on Tuesday it proposed to issue 750 million American-style call warrants on a basket of China consumption stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises:</p>
<p>  Guangnan (Holdings) Ltd		    0.0625 SHRS</p>
<p>  Ng Fung Hong Ltd			     0.0625 SHRS</p>
<p>  China Travel International</p>
<p>    Investment Hong Kong Ltd		 0.15 SHRS</p>
<p>  Glorious Sun Enterprises Ltd	     0.1 SHRS</p>
<p>  Goldlion Holdings Ltd			0.05 SHRS</p>
<p>  Champion Technology Holdings Ltd	 0.15 SHRS</p>
<p>  Tingyi (Cayman Islands) Holding Corp   0.125 SHRS</p>
<p>  Qingling Motors Co Ltd		     0.0625 SHRS</p>
<p>Guangdong Kelon Electrical Holdings Co Ltd 0.05 SHRS</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.316	 PREMIUM	 27.3 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.0905	GEARING	 3.66X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  07.JAN.97	PAYDATE	 27.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	MIN EXER LOT  100,OO0</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE    HK$3.316	 LISTING DATE  29.JAN.97</p>
<p> NOTE   PHYSICAL DELIVERY OR CASH AT THE OPTION OF ISSUER</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
